{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":69,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":6433,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1849092,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1399598443,"LastPoster":{"Id":282244,"Name":"JennaMC","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282244.jpg?_r=1425438861","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":23,"Preview":{"Id":1849092,"PostDate":1399598443,"PostContent":"After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton W...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Soon2beMrsJ, 08 May 2014 - 05:25 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1399598753,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10001714b026dbacc3397f779b5d2dcc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!! &amp;nbsp;We&#039;re so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849092,"PostDate":1399598443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!! \u00a0We're so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1849092]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-61586300-1399598292.jpg\" title=\"view from upstairs walkway.JPG - Size: 96.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-61586300-1399598292.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"view from upstairs walkway.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1849092]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-49260400-1399598301.jpg\" title=\"pool.JPG - Size: 95.89KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-49260400-1399598301.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"pool.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1849092]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-90750400-1399598307.jpg\" title=\"room.JPG - Size: 57.96KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-90750400-1399598307.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"room.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1849092]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-70169300-1399598317.jpg\" title=\"island off the beach.JPG - Size: 60.49KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-70169300-1399598317.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"island off the beach.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1849092]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-42096900-1399598320.jpg\" title=\"water sports.jpg - Size: 84.05KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-42096900-1399598320.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"water sports.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1849092]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-00939600-1399598328.jpg\" title=\"view from the gazebo.JPG - Size: 106.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-00939600-1399598328.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"view from the gazebo.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1849092]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-52694000-1399598333.jpg\" title=\"wedding gazebo.JPG - Size: 64.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-52694000-1399598333.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"wedding gazebo.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.184.186.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91fd3883e529fc2e59f6be0a694934e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"], I am getting married at the White Sands a few weeks before you! Could you send me the pictures you took? I do not have the necessary post count to view them. My email is cherylk1234@[member=\"gmail\"].com.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849112,"PostDate":1399601783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>, I am getting married at the White Sands a few weeks before you! Could you send me the pictures you took? I do not have the necessary post count to view them. My email is cherylk1234@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cherylk1234@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.184.186.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396144955,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CherJK","Id":277400,"Name":"CherJK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.36.235.231","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef473e9f6e32a2ca63dd03e434983d04","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"].....I am so glad you made your decision.&amp;nbsp; I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.&amp;nbsp; I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t decide between Secrets and Royalton.   I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your decision!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849121,"PostDate":1399602926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>.....I am so glad you made your decision.\u00a0 I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.\u00a0 I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.\u00a0 I can't decide between Secrets and Royalton.\u00a0\u00a0 I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your decision!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33ffa5561e26ffbe43387502ad625891","RawContent":"[quote name=\"CherJK\" post=\"1849112\" timestamp=\"1399601783\"]\n@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"], I am getting married at the White Sands a few weeks before you! Could you send me the pictures you took? I do not have the necessary post count to view them. My email is cherylk1234@[member=\"gmail\"].com.[\/quote]\nSure!  I&#039;ll email them to you now.  So fun that we&#039;re getting married in the same month!! \n[quote name=\"FutureMrsGlover\" post=\"1849121\" timestamp=\"1399602926\"]\n@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"].....I am so glad you made your decision.  I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.  I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.  I can&#039;t decide between Secrets and Royalton.   I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th. \n\nCongrats on your decision![\/quote]\nThanks!!  Both resorts are so beautiful so I can understand why it&#039;s hard to choose between them. Good luck with your decision!! Can&#039;t wait to hear what you pick  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1849122,"PostDate":1399603268,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>CherJK, on 08 May 2014 - 06:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>, I am getting married at the White Sands a few weeks before you! Could you send me the pictures you took? I do not have the necessary post count to view them. My email is cherylk1234@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sure! \u00a0I'll email them to you now. \u00a0So fun that we're getting married in the same month!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsGlover, on 08 May 2014 - 06:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>.....I am so glad you made your decision.\u00a0 I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.\u00a0 I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.\u00a0 I can't decide between Secrets and Royalton.\u00a0\u00a0 I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your decision!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!! \u00a0Both resorts are so beautiful so I can understand why it's hard to choose between them. Good luck with your decision!! Can't wait to hear what you pick \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.243.36.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bf5158878a1055d3b648e4ff6e6e11f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s great news. &amp;nbsp;Its really good you got to do a few site visits! &amp;nbsp;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849125,"PostDate":1399603448,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's great news. \u00a0Its really good you got to do a few site visits! \u00a0Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"liannabanana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.243.36.191","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1393122052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276829.jpg?_r=1397589644","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LiannaBanana","Id":276829,"Name":"LiannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Soon2beMrsJ, 08 May 2014 - 06:55 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1399604142,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0005023461102bff1fe81923f9ce5aa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LiannaBanana\" post=\"1849125\" timestamp=\"1399603448\"]\nThat&#039;s great news.  Its really good you got to do a few site visits!  Happy Planning![\/quote]\nThanks!! Yes, we were lucky to be able to see places in person. We stayed at the Riu Montego Bay so we were able to see a few of their weddings and drove to the Royalton for 2  hours. We stayed at Secrets Wild Orchid a year and a half ago. All amazing resorts!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849128,"PostDate":1399604057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LiannaBanana, on 08 May 2014 - 06:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nThat's great news.  Its really good you got to do a few site visits!  Happy Planning!<\/p><\/div><\/div><br>\nThanks!! Yes, we were lucky to be able to see places in person. We stayed at the Riu Montego Bay so we were able to see a few of their weddings and drove to the Royalton for 2  hours. We stayed at Secrets Wild Orchid a year and a half ago. All amazing resorts!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d71b2df80e35cd0e08e7ff2db547dd8","RawContent":"Yay!! So happy for you!! \n\n\nPam ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1849135,"PostDate":1399606282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n            