ent":"Thanks Pam!!! I&#039;m already picking out all my flowers from this PDF, so fun!!!\n\n\n:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1849325,"PostDate":1399671850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Pam!!! I'm already picking out all my flowers from this PDF, so fun!!!<br><br>\n<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed190d4da5600f9c2ef2bb5728236e1c","RawContent":":) no prob at all!! &amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1849329,"PostDate":1399672933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> no prob at all!! <3\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.24.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"926af5f15f4e1c9862fe7bedec103aa2","RawContent":"Congratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I&#039;m getting married there as well. You&#039;re lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I&#039;m new to forums so don&#039;t fully know the ins and outs. \n90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That&#039;s a lot of information.\nWhy can&#039;t I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums","Attachments":[],"Id":1849343,"PostDate":1399679745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I'm getting married there as well. You're lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I'm new to forums so don't fully know the ins and outs. <br \/>90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That's a lot of information.<br \/>Why can't I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dimps4dyz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.4.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394157595,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Dimps","Id":277037,"Name":"Dimps","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399680837,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a2c8b9119abd0c4ead9418dcd1121ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Dimps! Ayaya I know it&#039;s frustrating not being able to open attachments!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just emailed it to you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have to get to 150 posts before you can open anything on this site! Or pay $30 I think it is.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m at like 70 posts - feel like I&#039;m never going to get there haha&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;oh scratch that - just noticed I&#039;m at 81 posts ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849344,"PostDate":1399680874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Dimps! Ayaya I know it's frustrating not being able to open attachments!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just emailed it to you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have to get to 150 posts before you can open anything on this site! Or pay $30 I think it is.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm at like 70 posts - feel like I'm never going to get there haha<\/p>\n<br \/><p>oh scratch that - just noticed I'm at 81 posts <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf5ded57bb08ec89c97e812a828a8897","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Dimps\" post=\"1849343\" timestamp=\"1399679745\"]\nCongratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I&#039;m getting married there as well. You&#039;re lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I&#039;m new to forums so don&#039;t fully know the ins and outs. 90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That&#039;s a lot of information.Why can&#039;t I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums[\/quote]Thanks Dimps, congrats to you as well!!! I&#039;ll send you the pics today! :)\n\nHappy planning!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849514,"PostDate":1399755131,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Dimps, on 09 May 2014 - 03:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I'm getting married there as well. You're lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I'm new to forums so don't fully know the ins and outs. 90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That's a lot of information.Why can't I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks Dimps, congrats to you as well!!! I'll send you the pics today! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nHappy planning!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399908877,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a097ec46a31a50b78ff9eac3f2be51a1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Congrats, I\u2019m so happy for you!! I get so happy every time another couple books here! :D&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;We have also booked our wedding at Royalton, May 27\/2015! While I already have all the PDFs relating to the flowers\/services they offer, I can\u2019t see any of the photos, do you mind sending them to me? My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:slweddingplan@%5Bmember=&#039;&gt;slweddingplan@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Was Chandlyn the wedding coordinator at RWS? I\u2019m planning on emailing soon and knowing the wedding coordinator\u2019s name would really help!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849924,"PostDate":1399908841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Congrats, I\u2019m so happy for you!! I get so happy every time another couple books here! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">We have also booked our wedding at Royalton, May 27\/2015! While I already have all the PDFs relating to the flowers\/services they offer, I can\u2019t see any of the photos, do you mind sending them to me? My email is <a href='mailto:slweddingplan@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>slweddingplan@gmail.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Was Chandlyn the wedding coordinator at RWS? I\u2019m planning on emailing soon and knowing the wedding coordinator\u2019s name would really help!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389143480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03595208f4ee4b6b7a9e49f5be9bf3b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!!!&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re really excited to have our wedding at the Royalton.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Chandlyn is the Wedding Manager, but she also coordinates weddings.&amp;nbsp; I believe the other wedding coordinators are Laura and Ellie, but I didn&#039;t meet them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll email you the pics!&amp;nbsp; Happy Planning&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849934,"PostDate":1399912125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks!!!!\u00a0 We're really excited to have our wedding at the Royalton.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Chandlyn is the Wedding Manager, but she also coordinates weddings.\u00a0 I believe the other wedding coordinators are Laura and Ellie, but I didn't meet them.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll email you the pics!\u00a0 Happy Planning\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":69,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
