========================\nLots of Photos lol ceremony can take anywhere from 10min to 45min or above depending on what you're doing during the ceremony. Example would be the sand ceremony; if you do that the ceremony will be longer. After the ceremony for every destination wedding I've been at as well as seen during my ti...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79087-time-between-ceremony-and-recetion\/?view=findpost&p=1893553\n","Sender":{"Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429365553,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81092,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nyeah, they become my cleaning clothes. That's why I rarely donate clothes, by the time i'm done with them they're only good for rags hahah.\n-----------------------------\n\nLOL! And then used for cleaning rag...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1893564\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429362114,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81078,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n=