=======================\nOops I forgot to post a pic of my bridal silk robe for the wedding day!![emoji15][emoji38]  Don't mind the wrinkles LOL! [emoji13]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1893585\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429416102,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81103,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nJust finished my DIY bridesmaid\/maid of honor ask notes!! Mine are more for comedy over class [emoji12]  For bridesmaids gifts I gave 50$ towards each girls dress as well as:-A zipable beach bag with a bathing suit cover which is used as the bow of the bag! -Aloe vera gel (will definitely...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1893573\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429368103,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81097,"Title":"liked a post you made in Time Between Ceremony And R...","Message":"Hello!\n\nVictoriabride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLots of Photos lol ceremony can take anywhere from 10min to 45min or above depending on what you're doing during the ceremony. Example would be the sand ceremony; if you do that the ceremony will be longer. After the ceremony for every destination wedding I've been at as well as seen during my ti...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79087-time-between-ceremony-and-recetion\/?view=findpost&p=1893553\n","Sender":{"Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429365553,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81092,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nyeah, they become my cleaning clothes. That's why I rarely donate clothes, by the time i'm done with them they're only good for rags hahah.\n-----------------------------\n\nLOL! And then used for cleaning rag...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1893564\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429362114,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81078,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n=