ustom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.163.47.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78682,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01edb5a702e64a6a423d320ea632a6e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] It&#039;s in Puerto Vallarta!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Actually, I think it&#039;s technically Nuevo Vallarta, closer to Bucerias than actual downtown PV... but it&#039;s so much easier to tell people Puerto Vallarta, haha.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884207,"PostDate":1422290191,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> It's in Puerto Vallarta!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Actually, I think it's technically Nuevo Vallarta, closer to Bucerias than actual downtown PV... but it's so much easier to tell people Puerto Vallarta, haha.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"slfehr@outlook.com","IpAddress":"24.114.26.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420208577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.s