out in limbo without your date! But now, things are get started! Wooooo!!&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884228,"PostDate":1422305384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats!! So exciting! Kinda feels like your out in limbo without your date! But now, things are get started! Wooooo!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seriouslyamber@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420758542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281649.jpg?_r=1421027393","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Everly","Id":281649,"Name":"Everly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78682,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b204cbf9f318c8d2ae6f09bb3b94c29e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on choosing your resort! Only a year to go and you&#039;ll have lots to keep you busy during that time. The ladies here are great at passing on tips and suggestions and you&#039;ll find a ton of support here!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachmen