{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":81606,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHa extra money is always nice but two pairs of shoes - that's the BEST!!! lol told you...... total shoe slut here!!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893721\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429562629,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81587,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893754\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"TinkerSofi\" and @\"acw271011\" the sticky backing in those silicone bras are really good! At the end of the night, they were still on my chest. Yet, they were so easy to peel off! Like the pasties, just make sure you put the plastic sheet back so lint doesn't get on them and the adhesive doesn't dry (I guess). The further you place the chicken cutlets away from each other, the more of a cleavage you get when you clasp the middle. I'm not well endowed up there so I've taken advantage of this feature lol\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429557854,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81553,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that veryvalentine mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1893739\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"\n \nHere are just a few benefits that I know of!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \n \nhttp:\/\/www.lifehack.org\/articles\/lifestyle\/11-benefits-lemon-water-you-didnt-know-about.html\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429542632,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81524,"Title":"liked a post you made in Mrsctob's Planning Thre...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMrsCtoB just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOk so I've led a very sheltered life..... lmao so I have the really DUMB questions! What are JoJo Blings and what are Chinese laundry sandals?\n \nI love the guys in the vest and pants, and hubby in the suit looks super sexy! Just what I want Doug in. BUT did he find he was real...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78826-mrsctobs-planning-thread-3142015-valentin-imperial-maya\/?view=findpost&p=1893723\n","Sender":{"Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429539213,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81482,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYour weight loss is incredible! huge congratulations!! Could someone please tell me what lemon water does?\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1893704\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429533396,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81420,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Wafflesmom\" data-cid=\"1893647\" data-time=\"1429503490\">@  how did I miss your thread? I read from the beginning and I'm so glad I foundit. You have wonderful ideas and your taste in wedding dresses is great! I love the story about how you an...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893652\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429526350,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81362,"Title":"liked a post you made in Mrsctob's Planning Thre...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMrsCtoB just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"MrsCtoB\" data-cid=\"1893492\" data-time=\"1429297080\">Since I never got to post all my details, I figure I can post pictures now lol I will do a review of sorts here and finish with the details I left out. Let me start with what I have already...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78826-mrsctobs-planning-thread-3142015-valentin-imperial-maya\/?view=findpost&p=1893635\n","Sender":{"Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429523354,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81351,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Wafflesmom\" data-cid=\"1893647\" data-time=\"1429503490\">@  how did I miss your thread? I read from the beginning and I'm so glad I foundit. You have wonderful ideas and your taste in wedding dresses is great! I love the story about how you an...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893652\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429522402,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81325,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893654\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"  I like the first pair best... Blue is my favourite colour! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429514636,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81299,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893647\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" how did I miss your thread? I read from the beginning and I'm so glad I found\nit. You have wonderful ideas and your taste in wedding dresses is great! I love the story about how you and your hubby met and I admire your strength. I'm so glad that you guys are renewing your vows.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429489090,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81289,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAs most of you ladies know I've been married to the love of my life for nearly four years now. I definitely recommend it!! I truly wish for all of you young ladies the same level of happiness that I have if not more. If you have that, you will truly be blessed!\n \nThis is NOT a...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1888258\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429486873,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81285,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nlol I love that! chicken cutlets!! cool!  Seriously do you remember what brand it was? I've never seen gel ones. Only the sticky ones that I've only heard negative remarks about, namely that they're uncomfortable.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893638\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429485883,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81237,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893627\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" I would say they're true to size and the heel is quite comfortable. I'll go measure it in a bit haha. They're very similar to my salsa shoes in height. \n \nI was just telling my mom that I used to wear a size 6 in high school but now when it comes to heels i'm a 5 1\/5 or 5. So either sizes have changed, my foot has shrunk or I was totally wearing the wrong size haha. \n \nMy choice #1 will be to let the top part of the dress out a bit, and if that is a no go then I'll change it to the corset. I do love the corset back but I love the closing of this dress as it is. I agree that with the corset I wouldn't have to worry as much about the dress fitting. \n \n@\"calgarybride2015\" I ended up booking where I bought the dress. She gave me a rough quote of $350 for everything which isn't so bad and since she sold me the dress and is the one who suggested that she could do the corset I go there. I don't want any surprises and tears by going to someone else and them telling me that it can't be done. \n \nI'm going to go try these shoes again and hopefully make a decision. I really can't keep them both because with that money I could buy my undergarments and something else. \n \nTalking about undergarments. I have a bit of an issue with the top of my dress. I have a pretty small chest and the top fits fine but when I lift my arms I feel like i'm going to flash everyone haha (if I arch my back enough I actually do flash everyone lol). The seamstress said I don't need a bra and we'll just put some inserts on the inside of the dress. I'm not sure this will even fix the problem haha. I had inserts for my grad dress and I didn't really like them. They didn't push anything up and they had a life of their own. In other words they looked totally fake. I was thinking of getting one of those stick on strapless bras just to be safe haha. Has anyone tried that? \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429465607,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81230,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\" data-cid=\"1892855\" data-time=\"1428879210\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73939-las-diy-blog\/page-6...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893614\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429464219,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81228,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\" data-cid=\"1893609\" data-time=\"1429471209\">can you tell I am alone today and tired of all the purging I am doing in prepartion of moving <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \nYou may hate me, but..... I think I change my decision back to pi...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893617\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429464215,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81215,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that calgarybride2015 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893618\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"   Washed out is a great word to use.  There was something about them but couldn't come up with the word <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429462217,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81126,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nhellosassypants just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLadies today is the day!! May it be all that you dreamed off and more!! Can't wait for each of you to tell your story when you're back! !\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893476\n","Sender":{"Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429383239,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81033,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLadies today is the day!! May it be all that you dreamed off and more!! Can't wait for each of you to tell your story when you're back! !\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893476\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429354228,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80972,"Title":"liked a post you made in Any Gran Bahia Principe Run...","Message":"Hello!\n\nAdrie just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"ebecks\" data-cid=\"1886796\" data-time=\"1424355412\">I decided to just go with the photographer at the site, their facebook page show some pictures and they've really improved. I don't want to pay the vendor fee and don't want to rely on friends and...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/44634-any-gran-bahia-principe-runaway-bay-brides-out-there\/?view=findpost&p=1888629\n","Sender":{"Id":282360,"Name":"Adrie","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429302738,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80964,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nFutureMrsGlover just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLadies today is the day!! May it be all that you dreamed off and more!! Can't wait for each of you to tell your story when you're back! !\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893476\n","Sender":{"Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429300746,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80963,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLadies today is the day!! May it be all that you dreamed off and more!! Can't wait for each of you to tell your story when you're back! !\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893476\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429297999,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80952,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wallybags 66 Inch Tri-Fold...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI got mine on this site too from another bride, and it's already sol when we get back in October!! lol They recycle very well!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79062-wallybags-66-inch-tri-fold-destination-bag-90\/?view=findpost&p=1893079\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429284452,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80911,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893468\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429267720,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80909,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThat dress is so pretty! And I love the colour!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893467\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429267712,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80883,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nToes and fingers crossed!! The joys of AC. I know @  had absolutely the best thing with them but my experience sucks. I hate them. With a passion and only fly them when there are absolutely NO other options or when we have to use Doug's business points. Otherwise - FORGET IT!!!! lol I feel so...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892100\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429261088,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80849,"Title":"liked a post you made in Marinah84's Planning Th...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLove them!!! Can't wait for Sam to do ours!!!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1893363\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429228000,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80700,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThis might sound clich\u00e9 but in spite of what I said earlier, in some ways it does get better with time. Maybe because for me it has been since 1973, and because of the age I am now, I can think of my mom a lot more with a smile rather than a tear. I think I'm much more mellow about it now. The...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893355\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429193803,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80690,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893366\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Definitely going to ask my WC how it would work <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n@\"beckys98\" eek! I have enough room at one of my tables. The table is six right now, but may go down to 4 if their children don't come. Worst case scenario it would end up being a table of 10 with my vendors, best case it would end up being a table of 8. That's if the WC says that they would be eating with us on the sky terrace. I would only assume so to be perfectly honest.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429192692,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80678,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vendors - Seating At Reception","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI know when we got married in Jamaica, our photographer didn't sit down to eat at all until he was completely finished with our package time, and then he did sit down with us. We had included him with us for a meal, again it was just the two of us so it was no big deal.\n \nAn o...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893360\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429192403,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80666,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893358\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" That's really nice of you! I agree though. I definitely want to feed my photographers\/videographers.. I just didn't know if they would be sitting with my guests, or if the resort would have them sitting somewhere else? not too sure. I just wanted to make sure that they are fed! I'd feel terrible if they worked all day and didn't get a break somewhere in between to eat and take a moment.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429191857,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"401","TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
