Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":20,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":497,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1893384,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1429210416,"LastPoster":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1893384,"PostDate":1429210416,"PostContent":"Hi dear BDW ladies!\u00a0 I'm very new to the forum and i found that you are all very helpful!\u00a0  \u00a0 Can...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rmaranjyan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.56.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421767612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ruzanna","Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.196.168.24","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02259903a0a2ca22fe61201f08c8b98a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi dear BDW ladies!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m very new to the forum and i found that you are all very helpful!&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can someone please explain to me why does the number of guests matter in an all inclusive package? The food and drinks are included anyway right? so why does the price for the wedding change if you have 30 or 60 guests? What&#039;s the difference? :blink:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893384,"PostDate":1429210416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi dear BDW ladies!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm very new to the forum and i found that you are all very helpful!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can someone please explain to me why does the number of guests matter in an all inclusive package? The food and drinks are included anyway right? so why does the price for the wedding change if you have 30 or 60 guests? What's the difference? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':blink:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rmaranjyan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.56.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421767612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ruzanna","Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"742ade82f5d73f3ae7da8a4fdf8048d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and welcome to BDW!! @Ruzanna&amp;nbsp;when you state all inclusive package... are you speaking about the resort itself ? or the wedding package? Yes the resorts are&amp;nbsp;all inclusive ( if that&#039;s the resort type you select) so all food and drinks are included BUT the wedding isn&#039;t included in this. Its an additional event.&amp;nbsp;The wedding is an additional cost on top of the all inclusive $ you pay for your nightly rate. It all depends on what resort you select and what their wedding packages include. For example.. The wedding packages at the Royalton aren&#039;t very inclusive . Each plate is charged per person.. they can range from $40-80 all depending on what your meal selection is. They also charge for the chair set up etc per person. at AM resorts they are much more inclusive with the packages. One of their packages covers up to 25 people and every additional person then is charged per additional plate depending on your meal selection. Just have to do research on what&amp;nbsp;wedding packages are best for what your looking for! :) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope that makes sense! Good Luck!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893394,"PostDate":1429211473,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations and welcome to BDW!! @Ruzanna\u00a0when you state all inclusive package... are you speaking about the resort itself ? or the wedding package? Yes the resorts are\u00a0all inclusive ( if that's the resort type you select) so all food and drinks are included BUT the wedding isn't included in this. Its an additional event.\u00a0The wedding is an additional cost on top of the all inclusive $ you pay for your nightly rate. It all depends on what resort you select and what their wedding packages include. For example.. The wedding packages at the Royalton aren't very inclusive . Each plate is charged per person.. they can range from $40-80 all depending on what your meal selection is. They also charge for the chair set up etc per person. at AM resorts they are much more inclusive with the packages. One of their packages covers up to 25 people and every additional person then is charged per additional plate depending on your meal selection. Just have to do research on what\u00a0wedding packages are best for what your looking for! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope that makes sense! Good Luck!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422632988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6392572c54e54df20cafa36c1f2cae08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you are having a private wedding event at the resort, most resorts typically charge for this. Not sure about all resorts, but&amp;nbsp;it&#039;s because it&#039;s considered a private event. There are servers etc dedicated to you and your guests alone.. it&#039;s not the same service you would receive if you just walked into one of the resorts buffets and fed yourself.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893396,"PostDate":1429211674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you are having a private wedding event at the resort, most resorts typically charge for this. Not sure about all resorts, but\u00a0it's because it's considered a private event. There are servers etc dedicated to you and your guests alone.. it's not the same service you would receive if you just walked into one of the resorts buffets and fed yourself.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.196.168.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce91a94d4e2171c4ca3c306e5b950d28","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1893394\" timestamp=\"1429211473\"]\nCongratulations and welcome to BDW!! @Ruzanna when you state all inclusive package... are you speaking about the resort itself ? or the wedding package? Yes the resorts are all inclusive ( if that&#039;s the resort type you select) so all food and drinks are included BUT the wedding isn&#039;t included in this. Its an additional event. The wedding is an additional cost on top of the all inclusive $ you pay for your nightly rate. It all depends on what resort you select and what their wedding packages include. For example.. The wedding packages at the Royalton aren&#039;t very inclusive . Each plate is charged per person.. they can range from $40-80 all depending on what your meal selection is. They also charge for the chair set up etc per person. at AM resorts they are much more inclusive with the packages. One of their packages covers up to 25 people and every additional person then is charged per additional plate depending on your meal selection. Just have to do research on what wedding packages are best for what your looking for! :)\n\nI hope that makes sense! Good Luck!![\/quote] Yes an all inclusive resort. So you pay for your stay, your guests pay for their stay + you pay for the wedding ceremony which is all great! But my main worry is the guest count for the dinner. I know for a fact that with our friends and family the numbers will be approximate not exact LOL. So far I&#039;ve seen packages that would say 25 people or 30 people for 2000-3000.....what if you have 60? Thanks :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1893399,"PostDate":1429212267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 16 April 2015 - 11:11 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congratulations and welcome to BDW!! @Ruzanna\u00a0when you state all inclusive package... are you speaking about the resort itself ? or the wedding package? Yes the resorts are\u00a0all inclusive ( if that's the resort type you select) so all food and drinks are included BUT the wedding isn't included in this. Its an additional event.\u00a0The wedding is an additional cost on top of the all inclusive $ you pay for your nightly rate. It all depends on what resort you select and what their wedding packages include. For example.. The wedding packages at the Royalton aren't very inclusive . Each plate is charged per person.. they can range from $40-80 all depending on what your meal selection is. They also charge for the chair set up etc per person. at AM resorts they are much more inclusive with the packages. One of their packages covers up to 25 people and every additional person then is charged per additional plate depending on your meal selection. Just have to do research on what\u00a0wedding packages are best for what your looking for! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope that makes sense! Good Luck!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0Yes an all inclusive resort. So you pay for your stay, your guests pay for their stay + you pay for the wedding ceremony which is all great! But my main worry is the guest count for the dinner. I know for a fact that with our friends and family the numbers will be approximate not exact LOL. So far I've seen packages that would say 25 people or 30 people for 2000-3000.....what if you have 60? Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rmaranjyan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.56.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421767612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ruzanna","Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"998a9ee91830c3ff4be3e99df136d69f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The additional 30 you would have to pay the cost per person. Depending on whatever the resort states on their contract. So example.. You decide you want&amp;nbsp; wedding package for 3000&amp;nbsp;that covers 25 people and you have 60 guest. The resort states on the contract additional people will be $60. So you would pay 3000 + (35 additional guest x 60 pp) = $5,1000.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893400,"PostDate":1429213220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The additional 30 you would have to pay the cost per person. Depending on whatever the resort states on their contract. So example.. You decide you want\u00a0 wedding package for 3000\u00a0that covers 25 people and you have 60 guest. The resort states on the contract additional people will be $60. So you would pay 3000 + (35 additional guest x 60 pp) = $5,1000.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422632988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.222.15.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69d9c74cec1349b42b5988a428595e6b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1893400\" timestamp=\"1429213220\"]\nThe additional 30 you would have to pay the cost per person. Depending on whatever the resort states on their contract. So example.. You decide you want  wedding package for 3000 that covers 25 people and you have 60 guest. The resort states on the contract additional people will be $60. So you would pay 3000 + (35 additional guest x 60 pp) = $5,1000.[\/quote]\n :o  :o  :o  :o  :o  :o  Oh my.....we&#039;re gonna be in trouble LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":1893401,"PostDate":1429213846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 16 April 2015 - 11:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>The additional 30 you would have to pay the cost per person. Depending on whatever the resort states on their contract. So example.. You decide you want\u00a0 wedding package for 3000\u00a0that covers 25 people and you have 60 guest. The resort states on the contract additional people will be $60. So you would pay 3000 + (35 additional guest x 60 pp) = $5,1000.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/> \u00a0Oh my.....we're gonna be in trouble LOL\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rmaranjyan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.56.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421767612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ruzanna","Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24337cf94fc0a0bcc4c2c44ec78c1239","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;extra cost do take a toll&amp;nbsp; on budget. Just make sure to do your research&amp;nbsp; as much as possible. Ive heard from a few other brides sometimes its easier on the budget to build it up yourself versus getting the packages they offer.&amp;nbsp; GOOD LUCK!!!&amp;nbsp; Happy Planning!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893403,"PostDate":1429214318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>extra cost do take a toll\u00a0 on budget. Just make sure to do your research\u00a0 as much as possible. Ive heard from a few other brides sometimes its easier on the budget to build it up yourself versus getting the packages they offer.\u00a0 GOOD LUCK!!!\u00a0 Happy Planning!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422632988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.222.15.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cbb854039d6c0c2779790729cc50f7c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you very much for the valuable info @[member=\"racht33\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893404,"PostDate":1429215676,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you very much for the valuable info @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rmaranjyan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.56.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421767612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ruzanna","Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfe2c05db7c41ab4b49e42afb2f7fd08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I second @[member=\"racht33\"] - Definitely do your research and ask lots of questions. It IS crazy that you have to pay extra for food and drink at an all inclusive but eventually you accept that there is no way around it :wacko:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have 65 adults for our wedding in June. We are having a private reception, which is an additional $800 and includes beer and wine. To add liquor is is another $10 per person per hour! And then our package covers 15 people, so we also pay $20 per person over the 15 which includes set up, champagne toast, and cake pretty much. It adds up.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We also have a welcome event which, fortunately, our meal is not at an extra charge (not private) but the bar again is at $10 per person per hour.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also make sure you are asking about extra fees for vendors. Most resort charge a \"vendor fee\" if you use anyone out side of their preferred vendors for a DJ, hair\/makeup, photography, etc. Those fees vary wildly by resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893412,"PostDate":1429223896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I second @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> - Definitely do your research and ask lots of questions. It IS crazy that you have to pay extra for food and drink at an all inclusive but eventually you accept that there is no way around it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have 65 adults for our wedding in June. We are having a private reception, which is an additional $800 and includes beer and wine. To add liquor is is another $10 per person per hour! And then our package covers 15 people, so we also pay $20 per person over the 15 which includes set up, champagne toast, and cake pretty much. It adds up.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We also have a welcome event which, fortunately, our meal is not at an extra charge (not private) but the bar again is at $10 per person per hour.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also make sure you are asking about extra fees for vendors. Most resort charge a \"vendor fee\" if you use anyone out side of their preferred vendors for a DJ, hair\/makeup, photography, etc. Those fees vary wildly by resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b59ba5e3c33d6356cc11cbb7576c1205","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yup. It&#039;s annoying. I asked myself the same question: If my guests are all paying for all-inclusive food &amp;amp; drink, why does it cost so much more for the wedding dinner. I do get it to an extent. It&#039;s outside of the regular service they are providing both at your event and behind the scenes in the kitchen. They have to staff for it. But they are still making lots of $$$ off us!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our package is $3300 for 25 people (and includes a lot of extras - flowers, photography, videography, makeup\/hair, massage for 2, private dinner for 2 on the beach, soloist, etc.). Then it&#039;s $94 per additional person for dinner. This includes set-up, champagne toast, wedding cake, cocktail hour, etc. But these are also priced separately so, for example, I don&#039;t plan to add any extra wedding cake. We get a cake for 25 plus dessert, so that will save me $7 per extra person. Oh, BTW, this doesn&#039;t include the $5 per extra chair for the wedding ceremony! And, if we want our reception to go past 9, we have to pay $15\/person per hour for EVERYONE. Don&#039;t get me started on sound systems, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m sad to say that DWs are a nickle &amp;amp; dime experience.&amp;nbsp; :unsure:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893425,"PostDate":1429232306,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yup. It's annoying. I asked myself the same question: If my guests are all paying for all-inclusive food & drink, why does it cost so much more for the wedding dinner. I do get it to an extent. It's outside of the regular service they are providing both at your event and behind the scenes in the kitchen. They have to staff for it. But they are still making lots of $$$ off us!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our package is $3300 for 25 people (and includes a lot of extras - flowers, photography, videography, makeup\/hair, massage for 2, private dinner for 2 on the beach, soloist, etc.). Then it's $94 per additional person for dinner. This includes set-up, champagne toast, wedding cake, cocktail hour, etc. But these are also priced separately so, for example, I don't plan to add any extra wedding cake. We get a cake for 25 plus dessert, so that will save me $7 per extra person. Oh, BTW, this doesn't include the $5 per extra chair for the wedding ceremony! And, if we want our reception to go past 9, we have to pay $15\/person per hour for EVERYONE. Don't get me started on sound systems, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm sad to say that DWs are a nickle & dime experience.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79074","Title":"Does Number Of Guests Matter For All Inclusive?","LastPostDate":1429546661},"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
