{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429207780,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9dcedd764afb155e6264332af11ae81","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great question, perianjay! This is how we answered it on our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/faqs\/&#039;&gt;MTM Photography FAQ webpage here&lt;\/a&gt;:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Q) Do I have to buy a meal for you at the reception?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A) For packages that include coverage during\/past your dinner reception, please be sure to include 2 in the dinner reception (photographer and assistant).\n\nThis does not have be your reception dinner. This can include hamburger\/club house\/fries from the room service menu. As well, we prefer to have a seat\/table off to the side so we have a place for our equipment. As well, we will be getting up and running around to catch kissing\/events\/speeches\/etc during the dinner!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps out, as it works well for everyone in our experience - win\/win :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing everyone happy planning - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/1097883_10151771500249487_371813042_o.jpg\" alt=\"1097883_10151771500249487_371813042_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/v\/t1.0-9\/1174662_10151771499509487_1184498123_n.jpg?oh=efff72d08137377dee68a433f4ae93b2&amp;amp;oe=55A96B71\" alt=\"1174662_10151771499509487_1184498123_n.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/903270_10151481714834487_270975458_o.jpg\" alt=\"903270_10151481714834487_270975458_o.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/887258_10151481715479487_1602667798_o.jpg\" alt=\"887258_10151481715479487_1602667798_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1146189_10151771500879487_704063044_o.jpg\" alt=\"1146189_10151771500879487_704063044_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10368998_10152516865294487_2949865315081447320_o.jpg\" alt=\"10368998_10152516865294487_2949865315081\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893368,"PostDate":1429207394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great question, perianjay! This is how we answered it on our <a href='http:\/\/momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/faqs\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MTM Photography FAQ webpage here<\/a>:<\/p>\n<p>~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<\/p>\n<p>Q) Do I have to buy a meal for you at the reception?<\/p>\n<p>A) For packages that include coverage during\/past your dinner reception, please be sure to include 2 in the dinner reception (photographer and assistant).<br>\nThis does not have be your reception dinner. This can include hamburger\/club house\/fries from the room service menu. As well, we prefer to have a seat\/table off to the side so we have a place for our equipment. As well, we will be getting up and running around to catch kissing\/events\/speeches\/etc during the dinner!<\/p>\n<p>~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps out, as it works well for everyone in our experience - win\/win <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Wishing everyone happy planning - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/1097883_10151771500249487_371813042_o.jpg\" alt=\"1097883_10151771500249487_371813042_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/v\/t1.0-9\/1174662_10151771499509487_1184498123_n.jpg?oh=efff72d08137377dee68a433f4ae93b2&oe=55A96B71\" alt=\"1174662_10151771499509487_1184498123_n.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/903270_10151481714834487_270975458_o.jpg\" alt=\"903270_10151481714834487_270975458_o.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/887258_10151481715479487_1602667798_o.jpg\" alt=\"887258_10151481715479487_1602667798_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1146189_10151771500879487_704063044_o.jpg\" alt=\"1146189_10151771500879487_704063044_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10368998_10152516865294487_2949865315081447320_o.jpg\" alt=\"10368998_10152516865294487_2949865315081\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"985a6ceb62ecaa9e5cc24d5c8430bc12","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MomentsThatMatter\"] Thank you for the info&amp;nbsp;:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893372,"PostDate":1429207839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"210808\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/210808-momentsthatmatter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MomentsThatMatter<\/span><\/a> Thank you for the info\u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.52.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60f94be9124a7b88967922420f3cc246","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;here is what i always tell my clients to do, any vendor usually photographer and Videographer even a wedding planner. &amp;nbsp;We are usually onsite for more than 5 hours and yes is expected to get them a meal. &amp;nbsp;Some locations\/hotels would have a specific vendor meal and some would require you to get the same meal as for your guests. &amp;nbsp;Seating table, we always prepare a vendor table. &amp;nbsp;This table is usually just on the side\/ corner table, to keep the photographer closer incase of any action. &amp;nbsp; you do not have to seat them with your guests , but get them a meal.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893379,"PostDate":1429209417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>here is what i always tell my clients to do, any vendor usually photographer and Videographer even a wedding planner. \u00a0We are usually onsite for more than 5 hours and yes is expected to get them a meal. \u00a0Some locations\/hotels would have a specific vendor meal and some would require you to get the same meal as for your guests. \u00a0Seating table, we always prepare a vendor table. \u00a0This table is usually just on the side\/ corner table, to keep the photographer closer incase of any action. \u00a0 you do not have to seat them with your guests , but get them a meal.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.84.102.233","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f96de9faa1ecc9aafee6aa13e4673ee0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] &amp;nbsp;Definitely planning on feeding them but they arent sitting down at the long table with my guests. ill have to ask my coordinator where they can sit and eat&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893388,"PostDate":1429211094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Definitely planning on feeding them but they arent sitting down at the long table with my guests. ill have to ask my coordinator where they can sit and eat<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394223869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429211376,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5786c302d254beccfdf3b6e2810750f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smileitseb\"] ohh sorry. I thought you had questioned if they would be working the whole time?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think i&#039;m just going to see if an extra small table can be added. They would have to eat at my reception because it&#039;s on the sky deck and i&#039;d like them there during dinner too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893391,"PostDate":1429211289,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277044\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277044-smileitseb\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smileitseb<\/span><\/a> ohh sorry. I thought you had questioned if they would be working the whole time?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think i'm just going to see if an extra small table can be added. They would have to eat at my reception because it's on the sky deck and i'd like them there during dinner too.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.84.102.233","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9e54c9e8250e0beef4987ebc47f0237","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] yea i envisioned them just eating food here and there but still working. not actually having to sit down for an hour to eat&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893393,"PostDate":1429211378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> yea i envisioned them just eating food here and there but still working. not actually having to sit down for an hour to eat<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394223869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43b78f7ae9ebcd19f206efb34a25597b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smileitseb\"] from what i&#039;ve heard, I think that they still sit down to eat, but not for the entire time that everyone else is eating. I think my photographer also mentioned to me that moments of downtime aren&#039;t coming out of my hours in my package. Most photographers are pretty forgiving of the fact that the flow of the day isn&#039;t always ideal and that there&#039;s sometimes points where there&#039;s downtime. I&#039;m sure during the dinner they get up at points and do photos during the integral parts.. like speeches. Definitely don&#039;t want photos of me stuffing my face though lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893395,"PostDate":1429211539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277044\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277044-smileitseb\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smileitseb<\/span><\/a> from what i've heard, I think that they still sit down to eat, but not for the entire time that everyone else is eating. I think my photographer also mentioned to me that moments of downtime aren't coming out of my hours in my package. Most photographers are pretty forgiving of the fact that the flow of the day isn't always ideal and that there's sometimes points where there's downtime. I'm sure during the dinner they get up at points and do photos during the integral parts.. like speeches. Definitely don't want photos of me stuffing my face though lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.84.102.233","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"657bbe04bc5865e509ceef438a79303e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] dangit, so much to think about! my set up is literally perfect with the amount of guests we have, dont want to change anything with that, but gotta figure out where they can eat and set their things&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893397,"PostDate":1429211819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> dangit, so much to think about! my set up is literally perfect with the amount of guests we have, dont want to change anything with that, but gotta figure out where they can eat and set their things<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394223869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29c76e14441caf3333cd76a54ad189f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smileitseb\"] haha, I know! I was making my mock seating plan today (draft) and suddenly I thought about that part.. because I remembered hearing something about providing them dinner. The sky deck at my resort isn&#039;t very large so I think they may end up sitting amongst my guests.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893398,"PostDate":1429211923,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277044\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277044-smileitseb\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smileitseb<\/span><\/a> haha, I know! I was making my mock seating plan today (draft) and suddenly I thought about that part.. because I remembered hearing something about providing them dinner. The sky deck at my resort isn't very large so I think they may end up sitting amongst my guests.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.19.174.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429227216,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5d45eb4c0d02d6d3a386d1f717170b0","RawContent":"@[member=\"perianjay\"] we&#039;re setting up a small table just for our photographers. We&#039;re just having a small package that has 6 hours of coverage so with getting ready and our first look it takes us to the start of our reception. We&#039;re starting with our first dance so that they can capture it. My WC added it no problem. Even though they will be finished shooting with the rest of our reception left to go we thought it would be nice to include them. Our photographer added in an engagement session at no charge plus they should eat after working for 6 hours! ;)\nThey will be sitting with all of us but just at their own table. I guess in a way they have their own sweetheart table. ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1893418,"PostDate":1429227298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> we're setting up a small table just for our photographers. We're just having a small package that has 6 hours of coverage so with getting ready and our first look it takes us to the start of our reception. We're starting with our first dance so that they can capture it. My WC added it no problem. Even though they will be finished shooting with the rest of our reception left to go we thought it would be nice to include them. Our photographer added in an engagement session at no charge plus they should eat after working for 6 hours! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br \/>They will be sitting with all of us but just at their own table. I guess in a way they have their own sweetheart table. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415547511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
