IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78893,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by smileitseb, 11 March 2015 - 09:41 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1426066904,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e6aa4e8973b2b4e8455b0c30eb6aef2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TauruSmith\"] i want to buy the votive candle holders now. how do i send payment?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888990,"PostDate":1426066869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"252586\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/252586-taurusmith\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TauruSmith<\/span><\/a> i want to buy the votive candle holders now. how do i send payment?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394198669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"168.216.16.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78893,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03685713e1feb5f5376d04b34f246b15","RawContent":"private message me your email and address and I can send a Paypal invoice after I figure out what shipping costs are.\n[quote name=\"RJE\" post=\"1888939\" timestamp=\"1426036140\"]\nwhat size are the tank top and hoodie? \nand where are you located? (to estimate shipping costs)\n\nthanks![\/quote]Tank top and hoodie are no longer available!\n[quote name=\"Sandraco8\" post=\"1888916\" timestamp=\"1426017522\"]\nHello. I am interested in the 30 raffia fans. I know you said various sizes but can you give me an idea of an average?\n\nI may also have an interest in the pillars based on where you are located \/ shipping costs.[\/quote]\nHere is a photo of the fans on the chairs. I want to say they are between 10-12\" but I will measure them tonight. My zip code is 25302 for those interested. I know that shipping costs to Canada are very expensive for those who are located there.\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80360-fans-and-chair-ties\/[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1889069,"PostDate":1426140283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>private message me your email and address and I can send a Paypal invoice after I figure out what shipping costs are.<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RJE, on 10 March 2015 - 06:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>what size are the tank top and hoodie?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and where are you located? (to estimate shipping costs)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Tank top and hoodie are no longer available!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Sandraco8, on 10 March 2015 - 12:58 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello. I am interested in the 30 raffia fans. I know you said various sizes but can you give me an idea of an average?<br><br>\nI may also have an interest in the pillars based on where you are located \/ shipping costs.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is a photo of the fans on the chairs. I want to say they are between 10-12\" but I will measure them tonight. My zip code is 25302 for those interested. I know that shipping costs to Canada are very expensive for those who are located there.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80360-fans-and-chair-ties\/\" alt=\"80360-fans-and-chair-ties\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tpsmithslp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"168.216.83.100","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1331472185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252586.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TauruSmith","Id":252586,"Name":"TauruSmith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.196.44.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78893,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6084c1c1b81daf5170591e3da47a6e41","RawContent":"@[member=\"TauruSmith\"] - I pm&#039;d you yesterda