{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":81703,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSmellsey just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thanks for the tip on the badge holders and wrist coils. I've been trying to find good sellers, particularly to Canada!And your OOT bag contents are great! I'm sure all of their sales are consistent across the country, London drugs has Emergen-c on sale for $10.99 and there's a $5 off coupon...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893068\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429604130,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81596,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by TinkerSofi.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893754\n\nThe post that TinkerSofi submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893758\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"TinkerSofi\" and @\"acw271011\" the sticky backing in those silicone bras are really good! At the end of the night, they were still on my chest. Yet, they were so easy to peel off! Like the pasties, just make sure you put the plastic sheet back so lint doesn't get on them and the adhesive doesn't dry (I guess). The further you place the chicken cutlets away from each other, the more of a cleavage you get when you clasp the middle. I'm not well endowed up there so I've taken advantage of this feature lol\n-----------------------------\n\nI'll stop by David's bridal this weekend and pick up one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> so I have it for the alterations appointment\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429549444,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81591,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  and @  the sticky backing in those silicone bras are really good! At the end of the night, they were still on my chest. Yet, they were so easy to peel off! Like the pasties, just make sure you put the plastic sheet back so lint doesn't get on them and the adhesive doesn't dry (I guess). The fu...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893754\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429548343,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81317,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by acw271011.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893644\n\nThe post that acw271011 submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893653\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"TinkerSofi\" those chicken cutlets lasted a long time and were comfy. They never ended up on my belly and I think that would've been so funny if it did happen. I do believe you have to have dry skin with no lotions to make sure they stay. And I agree that it also freaks me out when I forget I have the nipple pasties on. The silicone ones totally blend in with my skin and it looks like I have no nipples at all\n\nSo believe it or not, I last bought the silicone adhesive bras at one of those kiosks in the middle of the mall. You know, the ones that sell curlers, cell phone covers, etc. you can check those out but not certain if they still sell them. In case they don't, I fund some research and the U.S. website for David's Bridal says they sell them for $31. http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/Product_Silicone-Adhesive-Bra-SIM\n-----------------------------\n\n \nThose are so cool!! So how do they stay in place? I see the clip in the front but what about straps, or a back? The price is pretty good too! How long do they last?\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429480924,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81314,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  those chicken cutlets lasted a long time and were comfy. They never ended up on my belly and I think that would've been so funny if it did happen. I do believe you have to have dry skin with no lotions to make sure they stay. And I agree that it also freaks me out when I forget I have the nipp...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893644\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429480848,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81313,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by acw271011.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893647\n\nThe post that acw271011 submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893652\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"acw271011\" how did I miss your thread? I read from the beginning and I'm so glad I found\nit. You have wonderful ideas and your taste in wedding dresses is great! I love the story about how you and your hubby met and I admire your strength. I'm so glad that you guys are renewing your vows.\n-----------------------------\n\n \nThank you. That's really nice. I look back at the last 3 and a half years and sometimes I wonder why things have gone the way they have. Ours is not to question why.... I know that and everything happens for a reason, but there are days that I can't help but wonder what the reason is. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429480513,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81306,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  how did I miss your thread? I read from the beginning and I'm so glad I foundit. You have wonderful ideas and your taste in wedding dresses is great! I love the story about how you and your hubby met and I admire your strength. I'm so glad that you guys are renewing your vows.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1893647\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429479873,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81304,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893648\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nYay for the Pink!!! Oh and I love the blue. They're super cute!!! I found one pair I really like but they don't have my size so I've put it on a flag if they do come along.\n \nI had cups sewn into my dress because I didn't want to wear a full bra when we got married and it worked out perfectly. They didn't look fake at all thank fully. The seamstress stitched them right into the dress. I definitely don't need cleavage unfortunately (less is definitely more!! lol) so I wasn't too worried about that, but Victoria Secret has some really nice strapless bras with push up, and with the new lighter fabrics they have, you could take a look and see how hot they might be, but I don't think they would be.\n-----------------------------\n\nyeah I think the inserts work great when you have a nice cleavage already but they just looked very strange on me, at least I felt weird and they weren't comfortable. It was almost like I had two pillows on there haha. Small chested problems I guess <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> \n \nI'll check out the different options. The biggest thing is that it has to be something backless or close to it because the dress goes down at the back and I don't want to worry about the strap showing. \n \n@\"Wafflesmom\" oh god, I've had my pasties for like a year now haha, those things don't quit. Only now I started noticing that the very edges don't stick on as much as they used to but they still work fine. I really don't know what happened that one night but we sure had a good laugh with my girlfriends about it haha. It's good to know that the glue is just as strong on the bras as it is on the pasties. I don't know why I felt like it wouldn't be because they were bigger and heavier. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429479698,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81301,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  those chicken cutlets lasted a long time and were comfy. They never ended up on my belly and I think that would've been so funny if it did happen. I do believe you have to have dry skin with no lotions to make sure they stay. And I agree that it also freaks me out when I forget I have the nipp...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893644\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429479177,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81274,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@ , after seeing the shoes with your dress, I do agree with everyone that the champagne doesn't look as vibrant and completely gets washed out. The pink looks nice and since they match Juan's tie, I say go for the pink!I have worn the sticky strapless bras, I used to call the chicken cutlets be...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893636\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429472683,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81271,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893639\n\n----------------------------------\nThanks girls. After a lot of back and forth. I decided to keep the pink ones for the wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> . Now it's just a matter of calling Norstrom tomorrow for them to send me a 5 1\/5 before they run out and I'll send the size 6 back. \n \nI have the stick on petals but never the whole bra because I was afraid that the glue wouldn't be strong enough. Only once I've had the issue where they moved. I had like a body suit on and all of a sudden I find one by my belly button and the other one somewhere on my ribs lol. I have no idea why as they were totally fine after and never had that issue again (maybe I put lotion on before wearing them, I don't remember). Lol @\"Wafflesmom\" they do look like that! haha. It freaks me out when I wear the petals because I always forget I have them and when I take my clothes off it looks totally freaky haha.Where are the ones you have from @\"Wafflesmom\"? I'll definitely give that a try because at least if I flash someone it will be with chicken cutlets lol. I really dislike the foam inserts they just looked weird all night, at least for me.\n \nI got the guy's ties today from Etsy! I bought Juan the one with the stripes. It was the only left so I ordered the solid pink ones for the groomsmen. I'll post more when they arrive! \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429469979,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81265,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@ , after seeing the shoes with your dress, I do agree with everyone that the champagne doesn't look as vibrant and completely gets washed out. The pink looks nice and since they match Juan's tie, I say go for the pink!I have worn the sticky strapless bras, I used to call the chicken cutlets be...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893636\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429468710,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81053,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893549\n\n----------------------------------\nThanks ladies! I think I'll keep the champagne. I do like them better, you're all right, they're more versatile, and they're less trouble because if I wanted the pink ones I'd have to return these and get them exchanged for a smaller size on the pink ones. I do have a lot of pink in my wardrobe so wearing them again wouldn't be an issue but I just like the sparkle on the champagne ones <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n@\"calgarybride2015\" oh yay!! Did you guy buy here? Welcome to the neighbourhood! We're actually not moving until august or september haha. They just broke ground this week <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> (apparently they had some issues with the building permits). Which is fine I guess, it saves us a bit of money during the summer to put towards buying some furniture. \n \n@\"Wafflesmom\" I'll look into the petals. I mean, they're comfortable but after wearing heels yesterday all day to work and then to the mall they did hurt a bit when I tried these on. Also, my right foot is smaller and the shoe is not as stable on that side, so maybe the petals will help.\n \nMy only criticism of these shoes is that I wish they made the strap size accordingly to the size of the shoe (this is what holds the shoe to your foot, there's no zippers or anything like that, just that bow). I have to pull mine all the way and on my right foot it's still a bit too loose. Let me tell you, I don't have dainty ankles either haha, they're pretty thick, so maybe for girls with skinny ankles the strap might be too big. Maybe I can write a review on them and add that so they may fix it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> because otherwise these might be my new favourite shoes! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429348595,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80998,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by calgarybride2015.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79084-when-does-the-sun-set-in-feb-in-cabo\/?view=findpost&p=1893519\n\nThe post that calgarybride2015 submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79084-when-does-the-sun-set-in-feb-in-cabo\/?view=findpost&p=1893520\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"calgarybride2015\" I was in PV last year and to me it seemed like the sunsets were pretty quick! They were beautiful! But I agree, wedding coordinators or even photographers in cabo would be the best to ask\n-----------------------------\n\n\nI could be wrong I just swear my photographer told me that. Don't trust me on this one whatsoever. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429301886,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80993,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893511\n\n----------------------------------\nLove them! I agree with @\"Wafflesmom\" and @\"calgarybride2015\" with the colour. I like the champagne colour best. I also think that the champagne will be more versatile down the road if you ever wear them again. Great choice though and even better that they are half decent for comfort as well. Not common with most heels!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429298101,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80986,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I love both of them too! I'm a sucker for brightly coloured shoes but I actually like the champagne ones more. I like the sparkle of the champagne. I don't know if you'll be walking on carpet at all at the resort but you can always buy grips from Walmart that you just stick to the sole for tra...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893509\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429297709,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80890,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893459\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" @\"calgarybride2015\" Yea! At first I didn't really think much about it, but it just randomly crossed my mind yesterday. My videographer was only hired for 4-5 hours, but i'd still want to feed him and his assistant too! I don't know.. I guess I just feel compassionate for them. I get they are there to work, but i'm sure they get hungry\/thirsty and I'm keeping them over dinner hour. I'd feel bad not making sure they are fed.I'm going to ask my WC and make sure they are taken care of too.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429251079,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80887,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vendors - Seating At Reception","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thanks for asking this question! We're only having our photographer for 5 hours and will only be there for the first hour of the reception. So like you, we'll be doing our first dance at the beginning (this will also coincide with sunset \u263a\ufe0f). I can only imagine the hunger my photography and hi...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893446\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429250955,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80875,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vendors - Seating At Reception","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thanks for asking this question! We're only having our photographer for 5 hours and will only be there for the first hour of the reception. So like you, we'll be doing our first dance at the beginning (this will also coincide with sunset \u263a\ufe0f). I can only imagine the hunger my photography and hi...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893446\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429244070,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80684,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nbeckys98 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sorry to hear about your mom. My dad passed away when I was only 6 years old but still miss him dearly. I get sad at the thought of not having a father\/daughter dance but I know he'll be there in spirit. My mom raised three kids on her own and I admire her for her strength. So it was a no...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893296\n","Sender":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429181729,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80628,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nkellymiller just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  when my dad passed away, my mom was left to take care of an 8 year old, 6 year old and 3 year old. His last year was spent in the hospital since he was having treatment for intestinal cancer. I do get sad at times not knowing if the memories I have of him are real or if they're made from stori...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893303\n","Sender":{"Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429172917,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80627,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nkellymiller just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sorry to hear about your mom. My dad passed away when I was only 6 years old but still miss him dearly. I get sad at the thought of not having a father\/daughter dance but I know he'll be there in spirit. My mom raised three kids on her own and I admire her for her strength. So it was a no...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893296\n","Sender":{"Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429172913,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80604,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"Wafflesmom,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nMakes sense!  No problem <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I think the best option is for someone from the states, it's only about $15 to ship most places.  \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9375&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429170845,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9375},{"Id":80582,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHugs back to you @ , I'm glad you had many years with your mom! I'm sure she's watching over your kids \ud83d\ude09and hugs to all you ladies too. I made myself cry while writing the post! Derrick got concerned lolI don't know how I'm gonna keep my composure when I say my speech to my mom. Thank god for...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893305\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429166503,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80581,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  when my dad passed away, my mom was left to take care of an 8 year old, 6 year old and 3 year old. His last year was spent in the hospital since he was having treatment for intestinal cancer. I do get sad at times not knowing if the memories I have of him are real or if they're made from stori...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893303\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429166482,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80579,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sorry to hear about your mom. My dad passed away when I was only 6 years old but still miss him dearly. I get sad at the thought of not having a father\/daughter dance but I know he'll be there in spirit. My mom raised three kids on her own and I admire her for her strength. So it was a no...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893296\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429166410,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80566,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I love your story! It's so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that's do Canadian of you  lolYou picked a great resort and it's great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893297\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429164163,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80553,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHugs back to you @ , I'm glad you had many years with your mom! I'm sure she's watching over your kids \ud83d\ude09and hugs to all you ladies too. I made myself cry while writing the post! Derrick got concerned lolI don't know how I'm gonna keep my composure when I say my speech to my mom. Thank god for...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893305\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429161570,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80550,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  when my dad passed away, my mom was left to take care of an 8 year old, 6 year old and 3 year old. His last year was spent in the hospital since he was having treatment for intestinal cancer. I do get sad at times not knowing if the memories I have of him are real or if they're made from stori...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893303\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429161526,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80544,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHugs back to you @ , I'm glad you had many years with your mom! I'm sure she's watching over your kids \ud83d\ude09and hugs to all you ladies too. I made myself cry while writing the post! Derrick got concerned lolI don't 